sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Equipment as Equipment
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Equipment: retire(reason)
    Note over Equipment: Policies: equipmentRead, equipmentWrite, equipmentExecute
    Note over Equipment: Guards (4)
    Equipment->>Equipment: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;active#quot;
    Equipment->>Equipment: guard[1]: self.registeredAt != null
    Equipment->>Equipment: guard[2]: self.deletedAt == null
    Equipment->>Equipment: guard[3]: roleAllows(user.role, #quot;inventoryManageAccess#quot;) or roleAll...
    Equipment->>Equipment: mutate.status
    Equipment->>Equipment: mutate.retiredAt
    Equipment->>Equipment: mutate.retirementReason
    Equipment->>EventBus: emit EquipmentRetired on equipment.retired
    Equipment-->>-Client: void